  "description": "Wi Han-young, a construction company CEO carrying the scars of childhood, collapses from a panic attack and is saved by pharmacist Han Jae-oh. The two are mysteriously drawn to one another and quickly fall in love. But someone who sees their relationship as a thorn in the side begins plotting in secret to drag them both into ruin... Can their love survive unscathed?\n\n---\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/Reverie), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/reverie)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/Reverie)",
